==Strategy==
This stages use Le'Behemoth and many peons to help support him. Bring strong [[Area Attack]] and [[Wave Attack]] units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]], and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] to deal with the peons. As for the Le'Behemoth, use [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] like [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] to break his shield, then send out an [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], and other powerful attacks to defeat him. Once he's defeated the rest of the stage should be easy to deal with. Do not be concerned about money in this stage, as the constant waves of peons give large amounts of cash.

